Hawkeye-X wrote:
> What is the best way to kill Asmodeus or is it not really necessary? I
> have a +2 Grayswider that doesn't seem to kill him as easily as I
> thought. I'm a level 16 valkyrie with -25 ac.

The Grayswandir is the best artifact weapon against that major demon.
But since he escapes if he's low on HPs you either have to constantly
follow him (by teleportation) or block his escape route (the upstairs).
Another possibility, the most effective, is to hit him with a rubber
chicken. Sometimes you can pay him without fighting, if you carry gold
in your open inventory; in this case it's not necessary to fight since
he will vanish after you gave him what he demanded.

